abstract: >-
  An experimental toolkit for correlation-matrix visualization and
  compatibility across runtimes, with a legacy-compatible R adapter,
  language-neutral matrix and scene contracts, a Rust shared core, and
  reference implementations.
keywords:
  - correlation matrix
  - data visualization
  - scientific software
  - Rust
  - R
